  "description": "Cloud-optimized USDA Forest Service geospatial layers from the Enterprise Data Warehouse, covering National Forest System surface ownership, administrative forest, proclaimed forest and ranger district boundaries, 2001 inventoried roadless areas, and roadless land-status strata. Also includes aerial insect and disease damage polygons and the survey-extent footprints used to normalize them, published as GeoParquet, PMTiles and H3 hex parquet.",
